[%# Welcome email, plain-text part (Welcome extension, lib/WebService.pm).
  # app_url: where the Bug Tracker app lives - the same address as in the bug
  # emails (template/en/custom/email/bugmail*.tmpl); update both together.
  #%]
[% app_url = "http://192.168.0.50:5175" %]
Hello [% user.name || user.login %],

[%+ invited_by %] has created your account on the Bug Tracker.

  Sign-in email: [% user.login %]
[% IF role %]
  Role:          [% role %]
[% END %]
[% IF products.size %]
  Products:      [% products.join(', ') %]
[% END %]

First, set your password with this link:

[%+ app_url %]/reset-password?welcome=1&t=[% token FILTER uri %]

The link works once and expires in [% days %] days (on [% expires %]).
If it has expired, use "Forgot password?" on the sign-in page, or ask your
administrator to send this email again.

After that, sign in here:

[%+ app_url %]/login

You will get an email whenever a bug assigned to you, or reported by you,
changes.
